<item>
<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-20T18:34:55.161Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:34:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities arrested five suspects linked to the murders of Canadian mining workers and detained a man known as El Talibán and four others in a kidnapping case, while protesters demanding clean water in Guadalajara were wounded as they tried to enter Jalisco's Government Palace. Ukrainian-origin fiber-optic drones are being trained for use by Mexican cartels, prompting continued border patrol challenges from drone incursions. A judge sentenced three men to 159 years each for the murder of three surfers on a remote beach, and an Arizona child murder suspect was detained in Mexico after a decade on the run. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE5qWmRWclljRkZMZEFkU00zYXloZ3RuTmJrWkdNQVpQVjBvSS16UVdEd3g0VVROa3ZjaTdVejE4YWgwRVFZNWxYV3NVQVRJRGJnaHB5Q1lUTkhXU0NCeTktMnFHQmFzVTBoUHdkSTBUWWN3NUkzVW9YWnFhTldVdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQYTBpZG9LZTVEZlU1ZExVT0JaUnZDSDBOMjVMM1JuOWRhb20zV05RS0ZqSnJLdmpKTXU5aWF6VmQ5WUVyTXA2cHBpclJKRFB4cnV5dC1pa210UUwwRTZYSE5PNHBUS05ldnJOU1hZLTFBY1h5b3lhMHVmMmM3UXpTUGxreTdBRnpxTy1NRDQwMzB3N0VCU1lobkV4RGVjWTNJV0F3bA?oc=5&quot;&gt;RSF&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KFDA | NewsChannel 10&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQcThLRFZsSWVPYWVKS2N6UVIxRlFzbVp0Znc2dUhYMUpKLVB2aGRDaEdtZWNyZHNSX1EyM0cwMmlIUEt3QWZmdmlXQVF1SjlBTGMyM25NMkR1UWgyUE1EWFBBejlvMV9WQlZnWFU1SmtxYkpxcmtwN1FDQXpzelpScUljOEpXNzZXcEpnbXJCTFhicHZHeDRfb1hiZUM3ZFA3Vl9wZWM4YWI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Laodong.vn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQeVFzZEhsb1FxZ3ZRYncyODc4OExQa05YeVJoUlJNQXR3YVF5S2JidGNEUHZEUWRsMFRtYjlBamdic0s4ZUhqSXFTZ0hlTjVEMHB1SGhsWVhSSk53djM5b0